DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     Function ddwwaarrff__rreesseett__sseeccttiioonn__bbyytteess() resets the internal state of a DWARF
     producer instance, so that the next call to the function
     dwarf_get_section_bytes(3) will return the byte stream for the first gen‐
     erated section, and the next call to the function
     dwarf_get_relocation_info(3) will return the first relocation array for
     the DWARF producer instance.

     Argument _d_b_g should reference a DWARF producer instance allocated using
     dwarf_producer_init(3) or dwarf_producer_init_b(3).

